<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He’s pow’rful, present, real and gracious;</l><l>Thou too canst touch Him now!</l><l>Just come and touch while He is still passing,</l><l>His power thou shalt know.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Just touch in faith and touch Him in spirit,</l><l>And He will make thee whole;</l><l>And peace that passeth all understanding</l><l>With joy will fill thy soul.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
